<h3>Hyperparameter sensitivity</h3>
<p>The three levers in SafeSpec interact predictably. Raising τ<sub>s</sub> (safety threshold) decreases ASR monotonically but increases over-refusal for ambiguous benign queries. Raising K decreases ASR substantially with negligible effect on throughput since Safety Mode rarely fires on benign traffic. Raising τ<sub>q</sub> (quality threshold) improves accuracy and surprisingly also reduces ASR — low-quality draft segments are more likely to be jailbreak-steered and stricter quality filtering implicitly filters them.</p>
</section>

