<div class="callout callout-green">
  <strong>The takeaway:</strong> safety and acceleration are not fundamentally incompatible. The incompatibility was in the implementation — defenses that operate outside the verify loop must duplicate work. Defenses that live inside the verify loop, amortizing over existing computation, can be both fast and safe.
</div>
